  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview (從 SAP 抓取「單位對照表」資料，把 SAP 內部單位代碼（MSEHI）跟外部單位縮寫（MSEH3）做好對應整理，輸出成一張乾淨的對照表 out_dt_UnitOfMeas。這正是前面分析過的 ConvertUnits.xaml 所需要的 in_dt_UnitOfMeas 輸入來源！)&#xA;Get data of table : T006 and T006A using [RFC_READ_TABLE].&#xA;&#xA;- Arguments&#xA;    in_SAPService as Connected session information &lt;IConnectionService&gt;&#xA;    in_FilePath as File path of Excel file to convert&lt;String&gt;&#xA;    in_LanguageKey as T006A -SPRAS (Language Key) &lt;String&gt;" DisplayName="GetUnitsOfMeasurement" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="973,2323" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_2">
